    "Build a Lions season ticket renewal journey with email, direct mail, and account-manager phone outreach.",
    "We need a season ticket renewal flow for the Detroit Lions. Window opens about six months before the season. Use direct mail packet first at T-60 days, then renewal-deadline emails at T-30, T-14, and T-3 days. For renewals not yet completed by T-30, route highest-LTV holders to an account-manager phone call before the T-14 email goes out. Suppress holders who have already renewed or opted out.",
    "Create a multi-channel season ticket renewal journey for the Lions. Mix of email, physical direct mail, and AM phone outreach, with the AM call prioritized for top-LTV holders."
