        "strategy": "Lead with a physical direct mail packet at T-60 days to signal intent and value, then layer email reminders at T-30/T-14/T-3 days. Route highest-LTV holders to an account-manager phone call for renewals not yet completed by T-30 to maximize retention on the most valuable accounts.",
